    "text": "MLBHow to watch Guardians and Reds games in 2026, TV and streaming Dan AulbachColumbus DispatchMarch 25, 2026, 6:03 a.m. ETMajor League Baseball is back in Ohio on March 26, and fans living in central Ohio are wondering how to watch Cleveland Guardians and Cincinnati Reds games.The Reds open their season with a homestand against the Boston Red Sox. The opening-day starter for the Reds is left-hander Andrew Abbott. An All-Star in 2025, Abbott led Reds starters with 5.6 WAR and posted a 2.87 ERA in his third season. He goes against Red Sox starter Garrett Crochet, the American League Cy Young runner-up in 2025.If you purchase through our links, the USA Today Network may earn a commission. Prices were accurate at the time of publication but may change.",
